      ],
      "source": "https://www.townshipofarcadia.org/arcadia-historical-museum.html"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Arcadia’s railroad history includes the Arcadia & Betsey River Railway, which linked the town to the Pere Marquette Railroad via Henry.",
